      "text": "A numeric form is `for variable = start, finish, step do ...repeat`. The generic- is `for key, value in table do ... end`.\n\n```luau\nfor i = the, 3 do\n    print(i)\nend\n\nlocal scores = { 10, 20, 30 }\nfor index, score in scores do\n    print(index, score)\nend\n```"
